---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const linkedInUrl = 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/erichoard/';
---

<Layout
	title="About Eric Hoard"
	description="Eric Hoard is an IT Infrastructure Manager, writer, and founder of Hoard Technology Advisors LLC."
>
	<section class="about-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<p class="section-label">About</p>
			<h1>Eric Hoard</h1>
			<div class="accent-line"></div>
			<p class="about-hero__role">
				IT Infrastructure Manager · Writer · Consultant
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<article class="section about-content">
		<div class="container about-content__inner">
			<div class="prose">
				<p>
					I started my IT career as a Data Center Operator. Not because I had a plan, but because I
					wanted to understand how things actually worked from the ground up. Thirteen years later,
					having held nearly every role an infrastructure organization has to offer, I became the
					person responsible for leading those teams.
				</p>

				<p>
					That journey taught me something that took a while to name. The technology decisions that
					matter most aren't really technical decisions. They're the ones where you're sitting across
					from a Cisco or Broadcom rep who knows you need them more than they need you, trying to
					protect your organization's budget and interests without the leverage that larger companies
					take for granted. Most IT leaders in smaller organizations accept that situation as just
					part of the job. I never stopped looking for a better way to handle it.
				</p>

				<p>
					That conviction is what led me to found Hoard Technology Advisors LLC, where I focus on
					technology strategy, vendor negotiations, and infrastructure decision-making for small and
					mid-sized organizations that are tired of being outmaneuvered by enterprise vendors and
					overwhelmed by advice built for companies ten times their size.
				</p>

				<p>
					Today I serve as IT Infrastructure Manager at Farm Bureau Insurance of Michigan, leading
					teams across Systems Engineering, Network Engineering, Database Administration, Unified
					Communications, and M365.
				</p>

				<p>
					If you work in technology leadership at a small or mid-sized organization, or you're
					thinking seriously about what smart IT strategy looks like outside the enterprise world,
					I'd genuinely enjoy connecting.
				</p>
			</div>

			<aside class="about-sidebar">
				<div class="about-card">
					<p class="about-card__label">Connect</p>
					<a href={linkedInUrl} class="about-card__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
						LinkedIn
						<span class="about-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
					</a>
					<a href="/blog" class="about-card__link">
						Silicon Hoard
						<span class="about-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
					</a>
					<a href="/consulting" class="about-card__link">
						Consulting
						<span class="about-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
					</a>
				</div>
			</aside>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-hero {
		padding-block: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 6rem);
		background: var(--color-off-white);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.about-hero__role {
		margin-top: 1rem;
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.about-content__inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 16rem;
		gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.prose {
		max-width: 40rem;
	}

	.prose p {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.prose p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.about-card {
		padding: 1.75rem;
		background: var(--color-off-white);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-top: 3px solid var(--color-burgundy);
	}

	.about-card__label {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--color-burgundy);
	}

	.about-card__link {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-navy);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
		padding-block: 0.375rem;
	}

	.about-card__link:hover {
		color: var(--color-burgundy);
	}

	.about-card__arrow {
		transition: transform 0.2s ease;
	}

	.about-card__link:hover .about-card__arrow {
		transform: translateX(3px);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about-content__inner {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.about-sidebar {
			order: -1;
		}
	}
</style>
